# Everything the toolkit writes about this repo: review/, eval/ and perf/ run output, the local
# config.json and install.json, init's backups/, and the rebuildable cache/.
# These are run artefacts and per-machine settings, not documentation: each report measures the tools
# or the code as they stood on its own date, so it goes stale the moment the finding it raised is
# fixed - and several in the tree already described behaviour that had since changed. Shipping them
# invites a reader to take a superseded measurement as current. The conclusions that survived are
# written up in docs/benchmarks.md, which is maintained; the raw runs stay local.
.claude/dotnet-toolkit/
